msgid "Review each slot's classification and code against the terminology-coding methodology: the authoritative scheme for the slot, the reuse-first rung, skos:exactMatch vs skos:closeMatch precision (ontologist), and any Rung 4 glossary candidates (promote valid ones from candidate to authored per glossary-terms, or replace them with an existing code)."
